# Dockerfile.ci packages only the two binaries produced by the CI build jobs.
# Keep the context allowlisted so repository files, local state, and secrets can
# never become available to this image build.
# These paths are a contract with Dockerfile.ci, ci.yml, and branch-image.yml;
# update them together. The PR docker-smoke job validates both architectures.
# Docker-only exceptions do not affect Git; /bin/ must stay in .gitignore.
*
!bin/
!bin/linux/
!bin/linux/amd64/
!bin/linux/amd64/laplaced
!bin/linux/arm64/
!bin/linux/arm64/laplaced
